{"id":29845,"imdb":"tt0072417","en":"A Woman Under the Influence","orig":"A Woman Under the Influence","ar":"امرأة تحت التأثير","tag":"A woman of today, her world, her passions.","ov":"مابل لونغيتي، يائسة ووحيدة، متزوجة من عامل بناء بلدية لوس أنجلوس، نيك. إنها غير مستقرة بشكل متزايد، خاصة بصحبة الآخرين، تتوق إلى السعادة، لكن سلوكها المتقلب للغاية يقنع نيك بأنها تشكل خطرا على عائلتهم وتقرر إلزامها بمؤسسة لمدة ستة أشهر. وحده مع ثلاثة أطفال لتربيتهم بمفرده، ينتظر عودتها، والتي تحمل أكثر من بضع مفاجآت.","rd":"1974-11-18","rt":155,"g":[18,10749],"lang":"en","budget":1000000,"revenue":12200000,"companies":[{"n":"Faces International Films","logo":null,"c":"US"}],"countries":["US"],"langs":["English","Italian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"US","d":"1974-11-18"},{"c":"CA","d":"1975-02-01"},{"c":"ES","d":"1975-09-20"},{"c":"GB","d":"1975-12-11"},{"c":"FR","d":"1976-04-14"},{"c":"DK","d":"1977-01-17"},{"c":"BR","d":"2007-02-08"}],"dir":["John Cassavetes"],"prod":["Sam Shaw"],"wri":["John Cassavetes"],"mus":["Bo Harwood"],"dop":["Mitch Breit","Al Ruban"],"cast":[{"n":"Gena Rowlands","ch":"Mabel Longhetti","p":"/j6Op08k2AkPGrNHpMNp30Pu8t36.jpg"},{"n":"Peter Falk","ch":"Nick Longhetti","p":"/e59x8ITouNlyz8Qa2abb5lxiQvI.jpg"},{"n":"Fred Draper","ch":"George Mortensen","p":"/ti3kVdLCdevTQFSo7D5ydA4PbnG.jpg"},{"n":"Lady Rowlands","ch":"Martha Mortensen","p":"/cm4hu8MDD6xjoaK6QAnCrV2oqA8.jpg"},{"n":"Katherine Cassavetes","ch":"Margaret Longhetti","p":"/fPsaFnxMoNaF8SymbvqYrSwyXkT.jpg"},{"n":"Matthew Labyorteaux","ch":"Angelo Longhetti","p":"/sjWJVXIM8y8tiOfN6cNS8iVwfMF.jpg"},{"n":"Matthew Cassel","ch":"Tony Longhetti","p":null},{"n":"Christina Grisanti","ch":"Maria Longhetti","p":null},{"n":"George Dunn","ch":"Garson Cross","p":"/fxAjTihhAvPFL3sC2PsduYBcZ4m.jpg"},{"n":"Mario Gallo","ch":"Harold Jensen","p":"/rogY5uQfrQHI0rr68q3AMmMOvay.jpg"},{"n":"Eddie Shaw","ch":"Dr. Zepp","p":null},{"n":"Angelo Grisanti","ch":"Vito Grimaldi","p":"/s9l16Go0hkp2KQfzkC4HUiPn55c.jpg"},{"n":"Charles Horvath